{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%.1f s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.1f 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ already on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這支手機上已有 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · expired %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@ 已到期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · no expiry date given": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 沒有寫到期日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · nothing is sent anywhere else, and nothing is kept afterwards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 不會送到其他任何地方，事後也不會留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · valid until %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 有效到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: failed": {
      "comment": "One ZK verification check",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：未通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: passed": {
      "comment": "One ZK verification check",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d fields · created %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 個欄位 · %@ 建立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d file(s) left over: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "殘留 %d 個檔案：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%llu ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%llu 毫秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(blank)": {
      "comment": "A disclosed field whose value is empty",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（空白）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file this app ships with is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 內建的檔案遺失了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh identifier was issued": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生了全新的識別碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proof is about %1$@, so sending it usually takes about %2$d seconds. Keep this screen open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一份證明大約 %1$@，傳送通常需要 %2$d 秒左右。請保持這個畫面開著。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proof was created but nothing checked it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已產生證明，但沒有任何人驗過它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real cardholder's signing material — but not that they are here, and not that this is their first time. Offline there is no shared record of what has already been used, so two checkers who never speak cannot both refuse the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一位真實持卡人的簽章材料——但不代表他人在現場，也不代表這是第一次。離線時沒有共用的已用紀錄，兩個彼此不通訊的查驗方無法一起擋下同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A refusal is not proof of a forgery. A wrong clock, a partial scan, or an out-of-date app produce the same answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「未通過」不等於偽造。裝置時間不準、條碼沒掃完、App 版本太舊，都會得到同樣的結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A signature cannot be taken back. The wall keeps nothing that says which one is yours — that is the same reason it is anonymous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簽名沒有辦法撤回。這面牆不保存任何說明哪一筆是你的東西——它匿名的理由就是這個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A signature field is present but empty — no signature was ever written into it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有簽章欄位，但它是空的——從來沒有任何簽章被寫進去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stored credential is damaged and cannot be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已儲存的憑證損毀，無法讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zero-knowledge proof is about 290 KB — too large for a QR code, so it arrives as a file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明大約 290 KB——太大了塞不進 QR code，所以是用檔案傳過來的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zero-knowledge proof is about 400 KB — far too large for a QR code, so it arrives over Bluetooth or as a file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明約 400 KB——遠遠超過 QR code 裝得下的量，所以它走藍牙或檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A123456789": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A123456789"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Bond": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於有備而來"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About the person showing it": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於出示它的人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this document": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關於這份文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address of household": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "戶籍地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All information are stored only on your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有資料僅儲存在你的手機中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already prepared": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已經備妥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also sending this over Bluetooth, so the checker does not have to scan every code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同時也用藍牙傳送，這樣查驗方不必一張一張掃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always shown": {
      "comment": "Trailing text on the field the holder cannot withhold",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一律出示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An empty signature field is not a signature — there is nothing here to verify. Treat this the same as unsigned, and say so when reporting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空的簽章欄位不是簽章——這裡沒有東西可以驗。請把它當成未簽章處理，回報時也這樣寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer a checker's code. Works with no network on either phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗方的條碼並回應，兩支手機都不需要網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered with a zero-knowledge proof, sent over Bluetooth. The checker never sees your certificate — but every checker sees the same duplicate-detection number, so they can still tell it is the same person.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用零知識證明回答，走藍牙傳送。查驗方看不到你的憑證——但每一個查驗方看到的去重編號都是同一個，所以他們仍然分辨得出這是同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered with your signed document, shown as QR codes or over Bluetooth. The checker sees your name either way — your certificate has to travel with it, and your name is inside the certificate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用你已簽章的證件回答，以 QR code 或藍牙出示。無論走哪一種，查驗方都會看到你的姓名——憑證必須一起送出，而姓名就在憑證裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the other person to scan this": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請對方掃描這個條碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up my national ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份我的身分證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up your national ID from the home screen first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請先從首頁備份你的身分證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始之前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Birth date": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出生日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth could not be set up on this phone (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這支手機無法設定藍牙（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth is not ready (state %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙尚未就緒（狀態 %d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth is switched off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙已關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth pairing code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙配對碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth sending has stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "藍牙傳送已經停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth was offered but this document could not be prepared for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方提供了藍牙，但這份證件無法為它準備好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bond": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有備而來"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both circuits completed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩組電路都完成了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built on this phone from your MyData record, and signed with your digital certificate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上用你的 MyData 資料做出來的，由你的自然人憑證簽章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera access is turned off by a restriction on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台裝置的使用限制關閉了相機權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain checking key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈驗證金鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate chain proving key": {
      "comment": "ZK circuit asset",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證鏈證明金鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate revocation snapshot": {
      "comment": "ZK circuit asset",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證撤銷清單快照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a document someone shows you, without contacting any server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗別人出示的證件，全程不連任何伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof file. The checking files are on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗一份證明檔。查驗用的檔案已在這支手機上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof file. The large checking files are not downloaded yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗一份證明檔。大型查驗檔案尚未下載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a proof file. This version cannot download the checking files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗一份證明檔。這個版本無法下載查驗用的檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a zero-knowledge proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗零知識證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗結果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check someone else's document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗他人證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the next person": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查下一個人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the proof on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上驗證證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked in %@, with no network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 完成驗證，全程未連網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this device: the proof does not hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在這支手機上驗證：證明不成立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this device: the proof holds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在這支手機上驗證：證明成立"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked on this phone, and it passed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上查驗過，通過"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking what's already downloaded…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在檢查已經下載了哪些檔案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a proof file": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇證明檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what they will see": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇要讓對方看到什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Code %1$d of %2$d": {
      "comment": "Carousel position",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第 %1$d／%2$d 張"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Computed on this phone from your digital certificate. The certificate itself is never shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這支手機上用你的自然人憑證算出來的。憑證本身不會被交出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已複製"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not reach the digital certificate service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法連線到行動自然人憑證服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't check the verification files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法檢查驗證檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a Valid Document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建立正式證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始產生證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a valid document from the home screen first. Nothing can be shown until this device holds one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請先回首頁，點「備份我的身分證件」建立一張證件。這台裝置還沒有證件之前，沒有東西可以出示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create the proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Created": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建立時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates a mathematical proof that your 自然人憑證 was issued by 內政部憑證管理中心, and checks its serial number against a revocation list this app cannot confirm is complete. The person checking the proof never sees your name, your ID number, or the certificate itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生一份數學證明，說明你的自然人憑證是由內政部憑證管理中心簽發，並把序號拿去比對一份撤銷清單——但這個 App 無法確認那份清單是完整的。查驗證明的人不會看到你的姓名、身分證統一編號，也不會看到憑證本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credential store": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證儲存區"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data and Privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料與隱私"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Date of birth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出生年月日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "診斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discoverable over Bluetooth — waiting for the checker to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已可透過藍牙被找到——等待查驗方連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Document code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "證件條碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Document information": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "證件資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Document-level signature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件級簽章"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download %@ · %@ on disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載 %@ · 佔用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download %@ · uses %@ on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載 %@ · 在這支手機上佔用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download the verification files?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要下載驗證檔案嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded and installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下載並安裝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded files stay on this phone, and a partly finished download is kept for next time. Unpacking starts over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下載完成的檔案會留在這支手機上，下載到一半的進度也會保留給下次使用。解壓縮會重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During an emergency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "緊急時期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one counts once. If your last attempt ended without an answer, that attempt very likely counted — signing again would add a second signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個只算一次。如果你上一次送出後沒收到回覆，那一次很可能已經算進去了——再簽一次會多一筆簽名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one counts once. Nothing of yours was published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個只算一次。你的沒有被公開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase all local data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除所有本機資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase all local data?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要刪除所有本機資料嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erasing really gives you a new identity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除之後真的會換一個新身分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錯誤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every checker sees the same duplicate-detection number, so two of them can tell they saw the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個查驗方看到的去重編號都是同一個，所以兩個查驗方對得出他們看過同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every field in your document: name, ID number, date of birth, household address and nationality. This version cannot show only part of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "證件裡的每一個欄位：姓名、統一編號、出生日期、戶籍地址與國籍。這個版本無法只出示其中一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyday": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded from backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已排除備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expected here — there is no Secure Enclave to use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡本來就是這樣——沒有安全隔離區可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experimental": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "實驗中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetch it again and replace what's stored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新抓一次，取代目前存的這份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Field named by their document: “%@”": {
      "comment": "Heading for a disclosed field whose name this build does not know",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方文件自訂的欄位「%@」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fields": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欄位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案保護"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files in Documents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Documents 裡的檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For this unzipping only, not to be used for any other purpose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅用於此次解壓縮，絕不另作他用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去安裝 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Application Guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往申辦指南"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Government wallet card": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "政府皮夾裡的卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Had turned 18 when issued": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發證時已滿 18 歲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hand this proof to a verifier": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把這份證明交給查驗方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden while this app is not in front": {
      "comment": "App switcher privacy cover",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 不在前景時已隱藏畫面內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the fields": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隱藏欄位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold this code still": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停在這一張"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold this up to the checker": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請把畫面對著查驗方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Household address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "戶籍地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ID number": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "統一編號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identifier": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "識別碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identity check": {
      "comment": "Default reason a verifier gives for a check",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身分查驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If erasing kept your old identifier, anyone you showed a document to before could recognise you again afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果刪除後還是舊的識別碼，之前看過你證件的人，之後還是能認出你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In this version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這個版本裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes your ID number and home address. Check who can see your screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含身分證字號與戶籍地址。先確認旁邊有沒有人看得到螢幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input National ID number (unzipping password)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請輸入身分證字號（解壓縮密碼）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issued by a government body through 數位憑證皮夾, and collected over the network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由政府機關透過數位憑證皮夾發行，領卡走網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issuing authority certificate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簽發機關憑證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries a number unique to this card that every checker sees, whichever fields you withhold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它帶著一個這張卡專屬的編號，不論你扣住哪些欄位，每一個查驗方都看得到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries no national ID number, because the certificate does not contain one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不帶身分證統一編號，因為那張憑證裡本來就沒有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries your national ID number, but that is a field you can switch off each time you show it — switched off, the checker sees only a commitment they cannot open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它帶著你的身分證統一編號，但那是一個你每次出示都可以關掉的欄位；關掉之後查驗方只會看到一個打不開的承諾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It claims to have been made %@ from now, so this phone cannot tell how old it really is. One of the two clocks is wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它宣稱的產生時間比現在還晚 %@，因此這支手機無法判斷它究竟多舊。兩支裝置其中一支的時間不準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It contained characters that can rearrange text on screen; they are shown as �.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中含有能把畫面文字重新排列的字元，已用 � 標示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It does not say how carefully your identity was checked. A card issued after a counter check and one issued from a web form look the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不說你的身分被查得多仔細。臨櫃驗過證件才發的卡，跟在網頁上填一填就發的卡，長得一模一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has no credentials for the digital certificate service, so nothing was asked for and nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它沒有憑證服務的憑據，所以沒有向你索取任何東西，也沒有送出任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is %@, which is far larger than a real proof. It was not sent, so the one-time number is still good.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它有 %@，比真正的證明大得多。它沒有被送出去，所以一次性號碼還可以用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is listed on this phone but could not be opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它列在這支手機上，但打不開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is stored on this phone and was read correctly. There is no screen for its contents yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它存在這支手機上，也讀得正確。只是還沒有顯示內容的畫面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is stored on this phone, and this build cannot read it. It is listed here so you know it was not lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它存在這支手機上，而這個版本讀不懂它。列在這裡是為了讓你知道它沒有不見。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have expired, or the wall may have changed its keys. Either way, starting again means making a new proof and signing again in 行動自然人憑證.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能是它過期了，也可能是牆那邊換過金鑰。不論哪一種，重新開始就要做一份新的證明，也要再在行動自然人憑證裡簽一次名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It resets at 08:00 Taipei time. Nothing was used up, so the same proof can go again while the one-time number is still valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "台灣時間早上八點重置。沒有東西被用掉，在一次性號碼還有效之前，同一份證明可以再送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was made %@ ago. A code taped to a wall or kept in a photograph looks exactly like a checker standing in front of you. Ask them to show a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它是在 %@ 前產生的。貼在牆上或存在相簿裡的條碼，看起來和眼前有人查驗一模一樣。請對方重新產生一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep going": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權條款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening over Bluetooth too — you can also scan their code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同時也在用藍牙接收——你也可以直接掃描對方的條碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening over Bluetooth — ask them to scan the code above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在用藍牙接收——請對方掃描上面的碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local data erased": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機資料已刪除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MOICA generation 1": {
      "comment": "Certificate authority name",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
