            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明檔漏掉了這種證明一定有的限制，所以沒有打開它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof is %1$@, which is more than the %2$@ this app will send over Bluetooth. Save it as a file instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明是 %1$@，超過這個 App 願意用藍牙傳送的 %2$@。請改存成檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof is incomplete on this phone. Make it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明在這支手機上不完整，請重新產生一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof is too large to send.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明太大，沒有送出去。"
