            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法建立證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot create a proof: it has no credentials for the digital certificate service. Nothing will be asked for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法產生證明：它沒有憑證服務的憑據。因此不會向你索取任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot download the files needed to check a proof, so a proof sent here cannot be checked. Say so before they send one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法下載查驗證明所需的檔案，所以送到這裡的證明查不了。請在對方送出之前先告訴他。"
