    },
    "This wording was written by the checker. This app cannot confirm who they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段文字是查驗方自己填的。本 App 無法確認對方的身分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three kinds of document, three different trust models. Each one gives something up, and it is not the same something — which is only visible with all three on one screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三種文件，三種不同的信任模型。每一種都放棄了一些東西，而且放棄的不是同一樣——那件事只有在三張並排的時候看得見。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three things someone might ask this app to prove, and what it can honestly answer today. Two of the three are only half answered, and this page says which half.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人可能會要求這個 App 證明的三件事，以及它今天誠實答得出什麼。三件裡有兩件只答得出一半，這一頁說明是哪一半。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to create the proof": {
